n, djon-djon mushroom, tomatoes, scallions, onions, garlic, brussell sprouts, green beans, asparagus, black beans, split peas, kidney beans, chickpea, and pumpkins</p><p>The two pioneers built Anytime Farmer\'s Market with an ideal to build fresh food for themselves the world. And also provide wonderful Haitian Cuisine.&nbsp;</p>\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"basic_html\";}}}s:13:\"field_summary\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:\"value\";s:97:\"Gives a summary about how Anytime Farmer\'s Market was founded and share the name of the founders.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:6:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:10:\"basic_page\";s:2:\"id\";s:1:\"3\";s:8:\"revision\";s:1:\"5\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"00c98b60-562e-474c-b801-b83c0a001a0b\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:5:\"owner\";s:1:\"1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:6:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:5:\"About\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:9:\"published\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";s:1:\"5\";s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;s:10